                "description": "The Square Lever with Square Rose is made out of solid stainless steel. Choose from either satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel finishes. This ADA compliant leverset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
